    "Business entities have voiced criticism over specific measures in the plan, particularly those limiting tax compensations.",
    "The Chamber of Deputies is scheduled to begin its formal debate regarding the fiscal proposal on November 23."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Moretti fiscal plan, a government-led proposal for budgetary adjustment, aims to assist the administration of President Luiz Inácio Lula da Silva in reaching the primary result target. The legislation involves various economic measures, including modifications to the Worker's Food Program and restrictions on tax compensations, the latter of which has drawn opposition from several business sectors. While some economists view the rules as temporary and necessary for fiscal stability, others express concerns regarding the potential impact on corporate cash flow for future years. As the proposal progresses, the government faces scrutiny regarding internal political support, with members of the left expressing varying degrees of opposition and support. The text will now move to the Chamber of Deputies for further review, with discussions slated to commence in late November 2026.",
